      "content": "yeah exactly. so basically, if the \"rules\" only exist when the big countries want them to, isn't it more accurate to say that global governance is just an obstacle to actual national sovereignty? like, why even bother with these organizations if they just end up undermining a country's ability to act in its own best interest?",
